table estate
- id (PK)
- name
- location
- created_at
- updated_at


table block
- id (PK)
- estate_id (FK → Estate.id)
- x_coord (int)
- y_coord (int)
- created_at
- updated_at

table tree
- id (PK)
- block_id (FK → block_id)
- estate_id (FK -> estate_id)
- min_diameter (integer)
- max_diameter (integer)
- height (integer)
- created_at
- updated_at

Estate stats
- estate_id (PK)
- min_height_tree (double)
- max_height_tree (double)
- sum_tree (integer)
- median_tree (double)
- last_calculated_at
- created_at
- updated_at
- total_distance_drone
